# Non-secret Switchboard BBS token broker configuration.
#
# The command must accept: get bbs.norllama-fleet.post-token
# It must return only the short-lived BBS post token on stdout. Do not put a
# bearer token in this file. Use Norman Keys or another approved, BBS-scoped
# broker before installing this as /etc/norman/tui-fleet-alerts.env.
#
# SWITCHBOARD_URL=http://switchboard.home.arpa:8765
# NORMAN_TUI_FLEET_ALERT_ACTOR=norllama-fleet
# NORMAN_TUI_FLEET_ALERT_WATCHERS=netops
# NORMAN_SECRET_CMD=/usr/local/sbin/norman-bbs-token-broker
